<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TH" style="id">- TarifitLS</book>
  <para style="h">1 Ayṯ-Salunik</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Sal</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Ayṯ-Salunik</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ṯabrat ṯamezwarut n arrasul Bulus ɣar Ayṯ-Salunik</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ṯabrat ṯamezwarut n arrasul Bulus ɣar Ayṯ-Salunik</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TH 1" />
  <para style="s">Lmuqaddima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 1:1" />Nec ḏ Bulus, akiḏi Silas ḏ Timutawus. <char style="it">Ntari ṯabrat-a</char> ɣar jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin n Ayṯ-Salunik <char style="it">iy yumnen</char> zi Arebbi Babaṯneɣ ḏ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ Siḏiṯneɣ. Akiḏwem yiȓi arḍa ḏ ȓehna.<verse eid="1TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus ḏ Silas ḏ Timutawus tcekkaren Arebbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 1:2" />Neccin ȓebda netcekkar Arebbi xawem marra, ntettar i Arebbi xawem bȓa ma a nbedd. <verse eid="1TH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 1:3" />Netxemmam zzaṯ n Arebbi iǧan ḏ Babaṯneɣ mecḥaȓ ixeddem lʼiman nwem, mecḥaȓ ṯrebbeȓ ȓemḥibbeṯ nwem, u mecḥaȓ iṣebbar lʼamal nwem ḏi Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ.<verse eid="1TH 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 1:4" />Ay ayṯmaṯneɣ yinni iƹizzen x Arebbi, nessen qa netta ixḍar-ikenniw. <verse eid="1TH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 1:5" />Liʼanna Lʼinjil iy netbeccar war d yusi ca ɣarwem s wawaȓen waha, yusa-d ɣarwem s ṯzemmar ḏ Arruḥ iqeddsen ḏ yijjen n uqennaƹ imɣar. Aqa ṯessnem mamc tuɣa netƹic jarawem ƹlaḥsab kenniw. <verse eid="1TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 1:6" />Kenniw ṯebḏam teggem mamc ntegg neccin ḏ mamc itegg Siḏiṯneɣ liʼanna kenniw ḏi ȓwesṭ n waṭṭas n tamara ṯqebȓem awaȓ nneɣ s ȓefraḥeṯ iy d yusin zi Arruḥ iqeddsen. <verse eid="1TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 1:7" />Ammu ṯḏewȓem ḏ ijjen n lmiṯal aṯ ḏeffaren marra ȓmuminin ig iǧan ḏi lʼiqlim n Masidunya ḏ lʼiqlim n Uxaya. <verse eid="1TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 1:8" />Zzaywem kenniw iy d iffeɣ ṣṣut n wawaȓ n Siḏiṯneɣ. Maci iffeɣ-d ḏi Masidunya ḏ Uxaya waha; Lla, iffeɣ-d ȓexbar-a x lʼiman nwem zi Arebbi ɣar yiwḏan ḏi marra imucan. X manaya war ḏaneɣ itxeṣṣi ca axas nessiweȓ <char style="it">minzi iwḏan tesȓan xawem</char>. <verse eid="1TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 1:9" />Iwḏan nni s yixef nsen sufuɣen xawem ȓexbar x mamc iy ḏaneɣ ṯqebȓem ḏ mamc iy ṯsemḥem ḏi lʼaṣnam bac aḏ tƹebḏem Arebbi iddaren iy iǧan ḏ ṣṣaḥ. <verse eid="1TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 1:10" />Ḥima aḏ trajam Mmis iy d ɣa yasen zeg ujenna wenni iy d isekkar Arebbi zeg imettinen iƹni Ƹisa iy ḏaneɣ isenjamen zeg uɣḍab nni iy d ɣa yasen.<verse eid="1TH 1:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TH 2" />
  <para style="s">Ȓxeḏmeṯ n arrasul Bulus ḏi ṯendint n Salunik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 2:1" />Ay ayṯma, kenniw s yixef nwem ṯessnem nnfaƹ nni iy d nuwi wami d nusa ɣarwem. <verse eid="1TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 2:2" />Ḏi ṯendint n Filippi ṯessnem belli tƹeddan xaneɣ ḏinni tbuṣaren xaneɣ. Walakin neccin nzaƹem akiḏwem, tuɣa itƹawan-aneɣ Arebbi bac a nbeccar jarawem s Lʼinjil waxxa can yiwḏan tƹarraḍen-aneɣ. <verse eid="1TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 2:3" />Awaȓ nneɣ iy zi netweṣṣa war d itis ca zeg uɣḏar niɣ zi min ixenzen niɣ zi ṯeḥraymiṯ. <verse eid="1TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 2:4" />Lla, iḍbeƹ-aneɣ Arebbi ikellef-aneɣ x wawaȓen-a iǧan ḏi Lʼinjil. Zi manaya nessawaȓ bac axaneɣ yarḍa Arebbi maci axaneɣ arḍan yiwḏan minzi ḏ netta ig iǧan ḏ wenni itmeyyazen min ɣarneɣ ḏeg wuȓawen nneɣ. <verse eid="1TH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 2:5" />Cuf, qa ṯessnem ƹemmarṣ ma nseȓha ḥadd s wawaȓen niɣ ƹemmarṣ ma neḍmeƹ ḥadd ƹlaḥsab ca n ssabab. Icehheḏ xaneɣ Arebbi! <verse eid="1TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 2:6" />War nexs ca iryazen aḏaneɣ cehharen: lla kenniw, lla can iryazen nneɣni.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TH 2:6">Neccin tuɣa nzemmar axawem nzeyyar s ssulṭa nneɣ am arrusul. <verse eid="1TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 2:7" />Walakin lla, neccin nxeddem akiḏwem s ttawaḍuƹ am ṯemɣarṯ ak ṯarwa nnes. <verse eid="1TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 2:8" />Ammu iy nethella ḏaywem netxes-ikenniw. Nfareḥ wami ncarec akiḏwem Lʼinjil ḏ ṯuḏarṯ nneɣ minzi ṯƹizzem xaneɣ aṭṭas.<verse eid="1TH 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 2:9" />Ay ayṯma, aqa ṯƹeqȓem x ȓxeḏmeṯ nneɣ qa neccin nuwṯa xas tamara. Wami kenniw netbeccar s Lʼinjil n Arebbi, qa nxeddem ǧiȓeṯ ḏ nhar bac war netbessiȓ ca x can ḥadd zzaywem. <verse eid="1TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 2:10" />Netƹic akiḏwem kenniw iy yumnen s yijjen n ṣṣfa ḏ yijjen n ubriḏ nican bȓa ȓƹib. Kenniw ḏ ȓechuḏ x manaya uȓa ḏ Arebbi. <verse eid="1TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 2:11" />Ntegg akiḏwem am yijjen n uryaz ak ṯarwa nnes. Netweṣṣa-kenniw netcejjaƹ-ikenniw netzeyyar xawem <verse eid="1TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 2:12" />bac aḏ tuyurem s yijjen n ṯicri iy ḏas iticcen lqima i Arebbi ig isḏaheǧ netta iƹni wenni iy ḏawem d itȓaɣan ɣar ȓmulk nnes ḏ lƹaḍama nnes.<verse eid="1TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 2:13" />Neccin netcekkar Arebbi <char style="it">xawem</char> bȓa ma a nbedd wami ṯqebȓem awaȓ nnes iy ḏawem d nessiweḍ. Ṯqebȓem-ṯ maci am wawaȓ n yiwḏan, ṯqebȓem-ṯ am wawaȓ n Arebbi nican. Ixeddem wawaȓ-a ƹaweḏ ḏaywem kenniw iy yumnen. <verse eid="1TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 2:14" />Ay ayṯma, ṯḏewȓem am ṯjumaƹ nni n ȓmuminin n Arebbi ḏi Ƹisa Lmasiḥ ṯinni iy iǧan ḏi ṯmurṯ n Yahuḏiya. Liʼanna iwḏan n ṯmurṯ nwem tbuṣaren xawem am Ayṯ-Yahuḏiya tbuṣaren x ṯjumaƹ n ȓmuminin iy ḏinni. <verse eid="1TH 2:14" /><verse number="15-16" style="v" sid="1TH 2:15-16" />Niṯni nɣin Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa ḏ lʼanbiya, uȓa ḏ neccin sufɣen-aneɣ ssenni. War xasen yarḍi ca Arebbi niṯni tƹarraḍen i marra iwḏan, ȓaḥeqqac war ḏaneɣ tejjin ca a nessiweȓ ak ȓegnus bac aḏ nejmen. Amenni ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ nsen arennint tƹemmarent, lƹiqab n Arebbi iwḍa xasen qaƹ.<verse eid="1TH 2:15-16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Arrasul Bulus ḏayes mezȓi aḏ iẓer ȓmuminin n Ayṯ-Salunik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 2:17" />Ay ayṯma, tuɣa nɣab xawem cway n ȓweqṯ, walakin ḏeg wuȓawen nneɣ war xawem nɣib ca. Ḏi ȓweqṯ nni netḥawaȓ aṭṭas bac a d nas minzi ḏayneɣ mezȓi akenniw nẓer. <verse eid="1TH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 2:18" />Mecḥaȓ n ṯwaȓaṯin nexs aɣarwem d nas, nec s yixef inu ƹaweḏ, walakin itqaṭeƹ-aneɣ-d Cciṭan ḏeg ubriḏ. <verse eid="1TH 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 2:19" />Liʼanna ḏ kenniw iy iǧan ḏ lʼamal nneɣ ḏ ȓefraḥeṯ nneɣ ḏ ttaj nneɣ n ccan zzaṯ i Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa xmi d ɣa yas. <verse eid="1TH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 2:20" />Wah, ḏ kenniw iy iǧan ḏ ccan nneɣ ḏ ȓefraḥeṯ nneɣ.<verse eid="1TH 2:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TH 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="1TH 3:1-2" />Iḏen, wami nugi a neṣbar ƹaḏ ktar, tuɣa nfekkar ḥsen a neqqim ḏi ṯendint n Utina waḥeḏneɣ, Timutawus aṯiḏ nessekk ɣarwem bac akenniw isejheḏ akenniw icejjeƹ ḏi lʼiman nwem. Netta ḏ umaṯneɣ ixeddem akiḏneɣ ḏi ȓxeḏmeṯ n Lʼinjil n Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="1TH 3:1-2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 3:3" />Nessekk-iṯ ḥima uȓa ḏ ijjen war iterjiji ca s ȓemḥayen-a nwem; Aqa ṯessnem belli manaya iy xaneɣ yurin. <verse eid="1TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 3:4" />Wah, wami tuɣaneɣ akiḏwem qbeȓ neqqar-awem qa ȓemḥayen axaneɣ kkent. Ḏ manaya ig iweqƹen qa ṯessnem kenniw. <verse eid="1TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 3:5" />X manaya, wami ugiɣ aḏ ṣbareɣ ƹaḏ ktar, ssekkeɣ-d ɣarwem Timutawus bac aḏ ssneɣ lʼiman nwem. Ggwḏeɣ wenni itɣarran tuɣa iɣarr-ikenniw s ibriḏen nnes uca min tuɣa nexḏem jarawem imken iḏweȓ axmi war neggi walu.<verse eid="1TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 3:6" />Ȓexxu iḏweȓ-d ɣarneɣ zzaywem Timutawus, yuwi-yaneɣ-d ijjen n ȓexbar ḏ aṣebḥan x lʼiman nwem ḏ ȓemḥibbeṯ nwem. Inna-aneɣ aqa txemmamem ḏayneɣ mliḥ, ḏaywem ƹaweḏ mezȓi aḏaneɣ ṯeẓrem uȓa ḏ neccin ḏayneɣ mezȓi akenniw nẓer. <verse eid="1TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 3:7" />X manaya ay ayṯma, neccin netwacejjeƹ s lʼiman nwem waxxa aqaneɣ ḏanita ḏi ȓemḥayen ḏ yij uziyyar. <verse eid="1TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 3:8" />Ȓexxu aqa netƹic mliḥ wami tbeddam nican ḏeg ubriḏ n Siḏiṯneɣ. <verse eid="1TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 3:9" />Mammec iy ɣa negg a ncekkar Arebbi xawem?! Mecḥaȓ n ȓefraḥeṯ iy ɣarneɣ zzaṯ i Arebbi ƹlaḥsab kenniw! <verse eid="1TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 3:10" />Ǧiȓeṯ ḏ nhar ntettar-as i Arebbi s wuȓawen nneɣ bac akenniw nẓer ƹaweḏ, aḏawem narni min ineqqṣen ḏi lʼiman nwem.<verse eid="1TH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 3:11" />Aḏaneɣ irzem Arebbi Babaṯneɣ abriḏ ɣarwem netta s yixef nnes ak Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa. <verse eid="1TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 3:12" />Aḏ yarni Siḏiṯneɣ ȓemḥibbeṯ nwem ak wayawya at isfeyyeḍ s waṭṭas ak marra iwḏan am neccin nexs-ikenniw. <verse eid="1TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 3:13" />Aḏawem isejheḏ uȓawen nwem bac aḏ tiȓim bȓa ȓƹib aḏ tiȓim muqeddsin zzaṯ i Arebbi Babaṯneɣ xmi d ɣa yas Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa ak marra ṣṣaliḥin nnes.<verse eid="1TH 3:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TH 4" />
  <para style="s">Ijjen n ṯuḏarṯ iy xef ɣa yarḍa Siḏi Arebbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 4:1" />Fa ay ayṯma ƹlaḥsab ṯimesȓayin nneɣni, kenniw qa ṯqebȓem zzayneɣ mamc iy ɣa ṯƹicem bac axawem yarḍa Arebbi; amenni ƹaweḏ iy tƹicem. Ȓexxu ḏi Ƹisa Lmasiḥ netḥeccam-ikenniw netweṣṣa-kenniw bac aḏ teggem ƹaḏ ktar.<verse eid="1TH 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 4:2" />Cuf, ṯessnem ṯimesȓayin nni iy zi kenniw nweṣṣa s ssulṭa n Ƹisa Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="1TH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 4:3" />Aqa ȓxaḍar n Arebbi itxeṣṣa-kenniw aḏ tiȓim ṯeṣfam aḏ tbeƹƹḏem zi lfasad. <verse eid="1TH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 4:4" />Itxeṣṣa aḏ tessnem mamc ɣa ṯḥekmem x ddat nwem ƹlaḥsab min iǧan muqeddes ḏayes aweqqar. <verse eid="1TH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 4:5" />Maci aḏ tƹicem ḏi ccehweṯ n ddat nwem mammec teggen ȓegnus war issinen ca Arebbi. <verse eid="1TH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 4:6" />Ƹlaḥsab manaya itxeṣṣa labud uȓa ḏ ijjen war iḍeǧem umas war ṯ itɣecci ca liʼanna ḏ Siḏiṯneɣ ig itxeǧasen x marra ṯimesȓayin-a mammec ḏawem ṯ nenna qbeȓ neƹȓem-awem xas. <verse eid="1TH 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 4:7" />Minzi Arebbi war ḏaneɣ d iȓaɣi ca bac a nƹic ḏi min ixenzen; Lla, iȓaɣa-yaneɣ-d a nƹic ḏi min iṣfan. <verse eid="1TH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 4:8" />Falihaḏa wenni itagin aḏ iḏfar ȓuṣiyeṯ-a ṯanitan ataf maci itagi i bnaḏem, itagi i Arebbi wenni iy ḏawem d iticcen Arruḥ nnes iqeddsen.<verse eid="1TH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 4:9" />Ȓexxu ƹlaḥsab ȓemḥibbeṯ jarawem war nteḥḏiji ca ƹaḏ aḏawem nari, mayemmi? Minzi iseȓmeḏ-ikenniw Arebbi s yixef nnes aḏ texsem ayawya. <verse eid="1TH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 4:10" />Wah, ḏ ṣṣaḥ texsem marra ayṯmaṯwem iy kiḏwem itƹicen ḏi lʼiqlim n Masidunya. Walakin netweṣṣa-kenniw ay ayṯma aḏ tarnim ƹaḏ ktar. <verse eid="1TH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 4:11" />Netweṣṣa ƹaweḏ aḏ tḥawȓem bac aḏ tƹicem ḏi ȓhudneṯ, aḏ taḏfem ḏi ccɣuȓaṯ nwem waha, aḏ txeḏmem s ifassen nwem. Amenni iy kenniw netweṣṣa qbeȓ. <verse eid="1TH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 4:12" />Ḥima aḏ tuyurem s lmaƹqul ak yinni ɣar barra nwem <char style="it">war yuminen ca</char>, war teḥḏijim walu zi ḥadd.<verse eid="1TH 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ƹlaḥsab ȓmuminin iy immuṯen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 4:13" />Fa ay ayṯma, war nexs ca aḏ tqefȓem i yixef nwem ƹlaḥsab yinni iṭṭṣen <char style="it">ḏeg imeḍȓan</char> bac war txeyyiqem ca am yinni nneɣni war ḏi iǧi bu lʼamal. <verse eid="1TH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 4:14" />Cuf, neccin ntamen belli Ƹisa immuṯ ikkar-d, ntamen ƹaweḏ belli Arebbi ƹaḏ aḏ iysi yinni iṭṭṣen <char style="it">ḏeg imeḍȓan</char> iy yumnen <char style="it">zi Lmasih</char> aḏ iȓin ak Ƹisa. <verse eid="1TH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 4:15" />Ƹlaḥsab awaȓ n Siḏiṯneɣ neqqar-awem qa neccin iƹni yinni ƹaḏ iddaren iƹni yinni ƹaḏ iqqimen <char style="it">ḏi ddunect-a</char> xmi d ɣa yas Siḏiṯneɣ qa neccin war netgaƹƹiḏ ca ḏ imezwura x yinni iṭṭṣen <char style="it">ḏeg imeḍȓan</char>. <verse eid="1TH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 4:16" />Liʼanna Siḏiṯneɣ aqa aḏ d ihwa s yixef nnes zeg ujenna s yijjen n ṯɣuyyeṯ ṯemɣar ḏ yijjen n ṯmijja n lmalak nni ameqqran ḏ zzammar nni itṣuḍen n Arebbi, ȓexddenni imettinen tuɣa yumnen zi Lmasiḥ aḏ d kkaren ḏ imezwura. <verse eid="1TH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 4:17" />Ssenni neccin iƹni yinni ƹaḏ iddaren iƹni yinni ƹaḏ aqaneɣ <char style="it">ḏi ddunect-a</char> ataf akiḏsen netwarfeƹ ɣar ujenna ḏeg iseynuṯen<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Iseynuṯen niṯni ḏ isegnuṯen.</char></note> bac a nmeȓqa ak Siḏiṯneɣ ḏi lhawa. Wa amenni akiḏes niȓi i ȓebda. <verse eid="1TH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 4:18" />Iḏen, cejjƹeṯ ayawya s wawaȓen-a.<verse eid="1TH 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TH 5" />
  <para style="s">Yum nni n Siḏiṯneɣ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 5:1" />Fa ay ayṯma, war nteḥḏiji ca aḏawem ntari x lʼawqat niɣ ḏ ttawarix. <verse eid="1TH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 5:2" />Aqa ṯessnem mliḥ belli Yum n Siḏiṯneɣ aḏ d yas am d yusa ij uceffar s ǧiȓeṯ. <verse eid="1TH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 5:3" />Ataf xmi ɣa yinin yiwḏan aqa ḏinni lʼaman ḏ ḍḍaman ȓexddenni axasen d ihwa ijjen n lxarab ḏeɣya amecnaw mamc d itas ȓeḥȓiq n ṯarwa i ṯemɣart itarwen. Ataf war zemmaren niṯni aḏ arewȓen.<verse eid="1TH 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 5:4" />Walakin kenniw ay ayṯma, war ṯeǧim ca ḏi ṯaǧest bac Yum nni axawem d ixḍeȓ am yij uceffar. <verse eid="1TH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 5:5" />Lla, kenniw marra ḏ ṯarwa n ṯfawṯ ḏ iḥenjiren n nhar. War neǧi ca ḏ ṯarwa n ǧiȓeṯ niɣ n ṯaǧest. <verse eid="1TH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 5:6" />Iḏen, war nteṭṭeṣ ca am yiwḏan nneɣni, itxeṣṣa a niȓi nfaq aɣarneɣ yiȓi ȓaƹqeȓ. <verse eid="1TH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 5:7" />Cuf, yinni iteṭṭṣen, teṭṭṣen s ǧiȓeṯ. Yinni itɣellan s ccreb, tɣellan s ǧiȓeṯ. <verse eid="1TH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 5:8" />Neccin lla, neccin ḏ ṯarwa n nhar, aɣarneɣ yiȓi ȓaƹqeȓ. A negg ṯjilit nni n ȓeḥḏiḏ iǧan nettaṯ n lʼiman ḏ ȓemḥibbeṯ. A negg lkask nneɣ iǧan netta ḏ lʼamal n ufekki. <verse eid="1TH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 5:9" />Qa war ḏaneɣ ixḍar ca Arebbi bac axaneɣ ikk uɣḍab; Lla, qa ixḍar-aneɣ bac a nenjem s ufus n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="1TH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 5:10" />Netta immuṯ xaneɣ bac a neddar akiḏes waxxa neccin nfaq niɣ neṭṭeṣ <char style="it">ḏeg unḍeȓ</char>. <verse eid="1TH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 5:11" />Falihaḏa tcejjaƹeṯ ayawya tƹawaneṯ ayawya mammec teggem ȓexxu.<verse eid="1TH 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ȓuṣiyaṯ ṯineggura</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 5:12" />Fa ay ayṯma, neqqar-awem weqqarem yinni ixeddmen jarawem ig iǧan xawem nehhan-kenniw. <verse eid="1TH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 5:13" />Ucem-asen ijjen n lqima ṯemɣar s ȓemḥibbeṯ nwem ƹlaḥsab ȓxeḏmeṯ nsen. Iȓim ƹaweḏ ḏi ȓehna ak wayawya. <verse eid="1TH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 5:14" />Ay ayṯma, nhaṯ yinni itbaƹen farq-ccɣeȓ, cejjƹeṯ yinni itefciȓen, ƹawneṯ yinni iteḍƹifen, ṣebbareṯ ak marra. <verse eid="1TH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 5:15" />Arrem-d ȓbaȓ nwem, itxeṣṣa uȓa ḏ ijjen war itxeǧis ccarr s ccarr nneɣni; Lla, ȓebda rezzuṯ min iǧan ḏ aṣebḥan jarawem ḏ jar yiwḏan marra.<verse eid="1TH 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 5:16" />Farḥem ȓebda, <verse eid="1TH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 5:17" />tettarem i Arebbi bȓa ma aḏ tbeddem, <verse eid="1TH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 5:18" />cekkarem-ṯ ḏi marra ṯimesȓayin. Liʼanna ḏ manaya ig itraja Arebbi zzaywem ḏi Ƹisa Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="1TH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 5:19" />War tsexsayem ca Arruḥ iqeddsen. <verse eid="1TH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 5:20" />War tseḥqarem ca awaȓen nni iy ƹeȓmen yiwḏan zi Arebbi qqaren-ṯen. <verse eid="1TH 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TH 5:21" />Lla, meyyzeṯ manayenni marra. Ṭṭfeṯ ḏi min iǧan ḏ aṣebḥan; <verse eid="1TH 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TH 5:22" />Aggwjeṯ x marra min iǧan ḏ aƹeffan.<verse eid="1TH 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TH 5:23" />Arebbi nneɣ n ȓehna akenniw issiṣfa ḏeg yixef nwem qaƹ. Buḥbeȓ nwem ḏ ȓaƹmar nwem ḏ ddat nwem aḏ qqimen kemȓen bȓa ȓƹib aȓ d ɣa yas Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="1TH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TH 5:24" />Wenni iy ḏawem d itȓaɣan ḏayes ttiqeṯ, ḏ netta iy kenniw ɣa issiwḍen ɣar manaya.<verse eid="1TH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TH 5:25" />Ay ayṯma, ttarem i Arebbi xaneɣ. <verse eid="1TH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1TH 5:26" />Seǧmeṯ x marra awmaṯen s yijjen n sȓam iṣfa. <verse eid="1TH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1TH 5:27" />Tweṣṣiɣ-kenniw zzaṯ i Siḏiṯneɣ ḥima aḏ tɣarem ṯabrat-a i wawmaṯen marra. <verse eid="1TH 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1TH 5:28" />Akiḏwem yiȓi arḍa n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ.<verse eid="1TH 5:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 5" />
</usx>